Description: A subset of LAPACK routines redesigned for heterogeneous computing (intel + mpich, OpenHPC)
 The ScaLAPACK (or Scalable LAPACK) library includes a subset of LAPACK
 routines redesigned for distributed memory MIMD parallel computers.
 Built with the intel compiler family and mpich MPI stack.
 .
 This package is part of the OpenHPC project.
